'''IT Crowd''' (IT系, ''IT Kei'', '''IT Oriented''') is a 2-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It is unlocked after completing [[Into the Future]] Chapter 3.

==Effect==
Accounting Power UP (Sm): Money gained when defeating an enemy increases by 10%.

